<subpara id="RM0000008Y3035X_03" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___00002PA00001">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), read the Freeze Frame Data. Freeze Frame Data records part of the engine operating conditions when a malfunction occurs, and this information is useful for troubleshooting.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM0000008Y3035X_04" type-id="01" category="01">
